OL,3,GNEWSANew shipbuilding hall opens at
OL,4,AHarland and Wolff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new manufacturing facility in Belfast
OL,7,Fwill be equipped to build ships to
OL,8,F"defend the UK for generations to
OL,9,Fcome," the owners of Harland and Wolff
OL,10,Fshipyard have said.
OL,12,FThe shipyard marked the official
OL,13,Fopening of its fabrication hall on
OL,14,FMonday, which will assist in the
OL,15,Fconstruction of three support ships for
OL,16,Fthe Royal Fleet Auxiliary.
OL,18,FThe Belfast shipyard's giant yellow
OL,19,Fcranes - nicknamed Samson and Goliath -
OL,20,Fare also being refurbished as part of a
OL,21,Fmajor investment programme.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
