OL,3,GNEWSANew shipbuilding hall opens at
OL,4,AHarland and Wolff
OL,5,
OL,6,FNavantia UK, which completed its
OL,7,Ftakeover of Harland and Wolff last
OL,8,Fyear, is funding the work as part of a
OL,9,F#157m investment in four shipyards
OL,10,Facross the UK.
